                    />
                    वनार्टी विद्यार्थी लॉगिन प्रवेशपत्र (Candidate Login Link)
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td class="p-3.5 border border-border-card">
                  <a
                    href="https://vanarticbt.thinkexam.com/candidate/login"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider rounded-xl transition-all shadow-xs w-full sm:w-auto no-underline"
